  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1623\">\n<p data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1623\"><strong data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1588\">46,XY pattern (1 X, 1 Y):</strong> Consistent with <strong data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1621\">genetic male</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1692\">\n<p data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1692\"><strong data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1655\">46,XX pattern (2 X, 0 Y):</strong> Consistent with <strong data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1690\">genetic female</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1872\">\n<p data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1718\"><strong data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1716\">Abnormal results:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1872\">\n<li data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1747\">\n<p data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1747\">45,X &rarr; Turner Syndrome</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1783\">\n<p data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1783\">47,XXY &rarr; Klinefelter Syndrome</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1811\">\n<p data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1811\">47,XYY &rarr; XYY Syndrome</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1872\">\n<p data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1872\">Mosaicism or atypical signals may require full karyotype</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
